===

title: FirstMeeting
---
???: ...
Ernest: Oh, I wasn't expecting to see anyone else out here!
Ernest: Who are you?  
???: ...
Ernest: My name is Ernest. What's yours?
???: You shouldn't be out here, it's dangerous.
Ernest: If it's so dangerous, then what are you doing out here?
???: .. I live here.
Ernest: What? That's so cool! I've always wanted to live in the forest!
???: You can't tell anyone you saw me out here!
Ernest: I won't, I promise.
Ernest: What were you doing anyway, standing there just now?
???: It's been a long time since anyone has come out here. I had to come see who the new arrivals were.
Ernest: Why don't you join us? We have a warm fire, and sandwiches!
???: I have everything I need out here.
Ernest: Ok...
???: … 
Alex: I'm Alex.
Ernest: It's nice to meet you, Alex!
Alex: I still think you should go back to your camp. Your friends would be waiting for you.
Ernest: Wait, before you go, why don't we meet here again tomorrow?
Alex: Why? 
Ernest: You have to tell me all about what it's like living in the forest!
Ernest: And I'll bring you a sandwich. 
Alex: Ok
<<set $firstMeetingDone = true>>
===

title: SecondMeeting
---
Alex: Ernest!!
Ernest: Ah! You scared me! 
Alex: Shh, keep it down. 
Ernest: You're the one who snuck up on me!
    -> Ernest: What are you doing here? 
    -> Ernest: How'd you get behind me? 
Alex: I have something I want to show you! Follow me. 
Ernest: What's this? 
Alex: I've been making these. There's some really nice looking leaves and sticks around here. If you collect them, you can make these cool patterns. You should try it for yourself! 
<<set $playLeaf = true>>
===

title: AfterLeaf
---
Alex: Hey, those look pretty good!
Alex: This is also a good way to make our presence known to the forest. 
Ernest: It's like graffiti
Alex: But way better. More natural. 
Ernest: Were your nails always that long? They look really sharp. I'm sure they weren't like that yesterday.
Alex: What do you expect me to cut my nails with? Does it look like I have any nail clippers around here? 
Ernest: Oh… sorry. 
Ernest: Where do you sleep each night? Surely you have somewhere to take shelter around here.
Alex: It's over those mountains, it's too far away for you to see. 
Alex: You can't stray too far from your camp.
Ernest: You're right. I should probably be getting back anyways, it's late. 
Ernest: I'll see you tomorrow though, right?
Alex: Yes, I'll be here. 
===